          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your faith makes you resistant to disease, protecting you as you offer succor to the ill. You gain a +2 status bonus to saves against diseases and poisons and to flat checks to recover from persistent poison damage. Allies in your champion's aura get this benefit, but their bonus is +1.</p>\n<p>In addition, if you roll a success on a save against a disease or poison, you get a critical success instead. (Your allies don't share this benefit.) If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Sacred Body] class feature, when you roll a critical failure on a save against a disease or poison, you get a failure instead.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
